This work is a modified version of Ice, as described in GPL-3.0 section 5.
Changes, made in 2026: the program was rewritten in Rust against AppKit
(objc2 crates) in place of Ice's Swift code. It reproduces a subset of Ice's
features, its UI design and text, its settings keys and the macOS mechanisms
it uses, worked out from Ice's source code and the installed Ice app (see
docs/ice-internals-evidence.md). README.md lists which Ice features are and
are not included.

